      "description": {
        "ja": "Base に Python 3 の開発環境 (venv、pip、uv、Poetry、pytest、Ruff、mypy、Black) を加えた構成です。python3・pip とツールは /opt/pytools の専用 venv (root 所有) から PATH に載るので、pip install はそのままそこに入り、OS の Python は汚しません。",
        "en": "Base plus a Python 3 development setup: venv, pip, uv, Poetry, pytest, Ruff, mypy and Black. python3, pip and the tools on PATH come from a root-owned venv under /opt/pytools, so pip install lands there and leaves the OS Python alone."
      },
